Description: High-Performance C++23 Asynchronous Web & Data Framework (dev)
 Aegon is a C++23 async web framework with HTTP/2, HTTP/3, Redis,
 ORM, and memory store support. Built on io_uring / IOCP.
 .
 This package contains the static libraries and headers.
